          "request": {
            "name": "Factset Upload a Custom Document",
            "description": {
              "content": "Upload any thrid-party documents that need to be included in the final PDF. Once uploaded, the successful response will be a unique fileurl that can be used to add the files to the PDF output using the create-book endpoint. Supported files include Powerpoint, Word, RTF and PDF. The total size should not exceed 250MB and each file should not exceed 10MB.",
